---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, LANG_TAGS } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
import { label } from '../../i18n/nav';
import { displayDate } from '../../lib/format';
import { breadcrumbSchema } from '../../lib/seo';
const lang = 'en';
/** Date de la dernière réécriture de cette page (aucun cookie, Clarity en mode sans cookie). */
const updated = displayDate('2026-10-06', LANG_TAGS[lang]);
const title = 'Salary Calculator Cookies in Greece: No Cookies Are Set';
const description = 'Greek salary calculator cookies: the site sets none and keeps no salary or children count on your device. Cookie-free Microsoft Clarity only checks that pages work.';
---
<PageLayout title={title} description={description} lang={lang} noindex={true}
  jsonLd={[breadcrumbSchema([{ name: label('home', lang), path: route('home', lang) }, { name: label('cookies', lang), path: route('cookies', lang) }])]}
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: label('cookies', lang) }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Cookies and similar technologies</h1>
    <p class="lead">This page completes the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a>. The site sets no cookie, first-party or third-party, and the salary, tax and benefit calculators save nothing on your device.</p>

    <h2>Categories</h2>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Strictly necessary cookies</td><td>none</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Analytics or profiling cookies</td><td>none</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Advertising</td><td>none</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Technical stability check (Microsoft Clarity)</td><td>cookie-free, content masked</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p>The gross salary, children or age you type are calculated inside the page and are gone when you close it: they are written neither to a cookie nor to the browser’s local storage. That is why you will not see any cookie pop-up: there is nothing to accept.</p>

    <h2>Anonymous stability check</h2>
    <p>To spot pages that fail to load, errors in a calculator or buttons that do not respond, we use Microsoft Clarity in cookie-free mode. Clarity then places no <code>_clck</code>, <code>_clsk</code>, <code>MUID</code> or <code>CLID</code>; each page view gets its own single-use identifier, visits are not tied together, and page text and amounts are masked before anything is sent. Only errors, load times, clicks without effect and scrolling are measured. The publisher records no personal data.</p>

    <h2>And the link with the result?</h2>
    <p>After you change a field, the calculator writes the values into the page address so you can send the calculation. That is not a cookie: nothing stays on your device beyond ordinary browsing history.</p>

    <h2>If you want to block it</h2>
    <p>Block the <code>clarity.ms</code> domain in your browser or with a content-blocking add-on. The calculators work exactly the same.</p>
    <p>Questions: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. Version of {updated}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
